  "business_rules": [
    "Deleted records (IsDeleted = 1) should normally be excluded from reporting.",
    "DateOfBirth is the preferred date column for period-based reporting.",
    "Columns role_level, category, user_type classify the record; check the distinct values before filtering on them.",
    "Join to Internal Departments, User Roles through the foreign key columns to resolve names."
